    "description": {
      "en": "National (state-scale) share of the marginal rate, 15%, that would apply to the top bracket of Spain's savings/capital-income tax scale, above the $tin_capinc_lim4 threshold. Combined with its regional counterpart $tin_capinc_regrate5 (also 15%), it would sum to the 30% total rate stored in $tin_capinc_ratrate5. Defined in tin_cons_es, but — per direct inspection of the ES policy spine — not referenced by the active 'National tax schedule on capital income' SchedCalc in tinit_es/tinjt_es, which currently stops at the fourth bracket ($tin_capinc_natrate4); this matches its 'unused' status in the extracted usage data."
